{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c5a5b45874aab97d41b20302ea8125913837a4cef20f5fdfb3ed0a5eb5a0b254", "ja": "（今日は新しい衣装のフィッティングをする日だ。\n似合っているように見えるけど、雪歩はどうかな……）", "zh": "（今天是试穿新服装的日子。\n看起来挺合身的，不过雪步觉得怎么样呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1001_p", "source_sha256": "89962872db2b72650a409875ee0af07edcc2d64e1eb58e70ee8a020809ccf57c", "ja": "どうだ雪歩？　衣装できつかったり、\nぶかぶかだったりするところはあるか？", "zh": "雪步，感觉怎么样？服装有没有太紧或者太松的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "276568973c4dfbc2116766faee6500a4790aeb513128af5d843b8f03376954b1", "ja": "いえ、サイズぴったりです！\nありがとうございます、{$P$}！", "zh": "没有，尺寸非常合身！\n谢谢您，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f5ad75bd6cf3cc097e88b785919da2423aa62b4eca553a0dad1380b683bbaca6", "ja": "カッコよくて、素敵な衣装で……、\nサイズはぴったりで……。あ、でも……。", "zh": "帅气又漂亮的服装……  \n尺寸也正合适……啊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5d1f978dc5b75fe5b84b7e99b6a000ce2428fd122f3adff95fb77ece68bffc1f", "ja": "どうした？\n何か、気になることがあるのか？", "zh": "怎么了？\n有什么在意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d1f4fd447ffa98d4b835cf7a7d5e885372ae00f93bc023df84262b974a66cbcc", "ja": "えっと……これ、本当に私に似合ってますか？\nちょっと、カッコよすぎる気がして……。", "zh": "那个……这个真的适合我吗？\n总觉得……有点太帅了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b8d52dd9a560c928b2ca90e47e3775cfd1e8a2f1d487b2340fa913ec0a64da18", "ja": "ステージ用だってことは、わかってるんですけど。\nいつもは全然、着ない感じの服だから……。", "zh": "我知道这是舞台上要穿的衣服。\n只是这种风格的衣服，我平时完全不会穿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "44b8ce85d316e433fdcf62d8273ebca95cd000ee544d759ac33c3ec8298c6606", "ja": "はっ。も、もしかして私、自分で気づかないうちに、\nこういうイメージのアイドルに……！？", "zh": "啊。难、难道我在自己都没察觉的时候，已经变成这种形象的偶像了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9f4aa8b504e77608a2765c04078865261f383d247865a9da43489d214c67a77b", "ja": "いや、確かに今回の衣装は、雪歩の普段のイメージとは\nまったく違うよ。正反対だ。", "zh": "不，这次的服装，确实和雪步平时的形象\n完全不一样。可以说是正相反。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "46317dd7910698fca47484e81bb2ca3951558d01b0360a245035fcd736109be7", "ja": "や、やっぱり……そうですよね。ちんちくりんな私に\nこんなカッコいい衣装、似合うはずないですよね……。", "zh": "果、果然……是这样吧。像我这样又矮又不起眼的人，怎么可能适合这么帅气的服装呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fcd8f9f0c4b3c69601524ee0a183e1fdb1d2b74014d82f66bf16028f0b25e5d5", "ja": "素敵な衣装をもらって浮かれちゃいましたけど、所詮\n勘違いで……私なんてグズでのろまでダメダメで……！", "zh": "我因为收到这么棒的服装而得意忘形了，可说到底只是一场误会……像我这种废柴，又笨手笨脚、慢吞吞的，什么都做不好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c144709994a766c41d67f0eda44e51c66c9dfbfadf739446fa1d1311d0dc8fe9", "ja": "ま、待て待て雪歩、最後まで聞いてくれ！　普段の\nイメージと違うことがいいんだ、それが狙いなんだよ！", "zh": "等、等一下雪步，听我把话说完！就是要和你平时的形象不一样，这正是目的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6cf897f9469aa7bd01f6a6be52d4394934a0b16f2d237c92c69c56708471c1a2", "ja": "え？　普段と違うことが、狙い……ですか？", "zh": "诶？和往常不同，才是目标……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1013_p", "source_sha256": "13b4a332c484bfb1d56c1998a9cdc43be8194c5d80047e0973a85d3278bee267", "ja": "あえて反対のものを合わせることで、素材の良さを\n引き立てる！　それが、今回の衣装のテーマなんだ。", "zh": "故意地将相反的元素结合起来，反而能凸显出材质本身的优点！这就是这次服装的主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6d060a099107f7f4b8fa210ab5cf054bad9a6e2822d6bcfbf91053ae378e7ef3", "ja": "反対のものを合わせて、素材の良さを……。\nお汁粉に塩昆布を添える、みたいな？", "zh": "搭配相反的元素，让材质的优点……  \n就像在红豆汤旁配上咸昆布一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fc583d704ca61e0099c6cb1745ffa3424159212c6663260a5eac8276db4065ce", "ja": "うん……まあ、そんな感じだ。甘いお汁粉に、\nしょっぱい塩昆布を合わせると、どうなる？", "zh": "嗯……大概就是那种感觉。把甜甜的红豆年糕汤和咸咸的盐昆布搭配在一起，会变成什么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "edcc71c26234eb39ca0340c98b730993a2621c875e9e919996b1aa898d81a297", "ja": "はい。お汁粉も塩昆布も、味わいがぐ～んと\n深まって、ますます美味しくなりますね。", "zh": "是的。无论是红豆汤还是盐昆布，味道都会变得更加醇厚，\n也会越来越美味呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b407d5cfdb49f3cb68157deeb1d5b616cbfebb940ebe7f15a96442e0e5e2c27b", "ja": "そうそう。それと同じで、落ち着いた雪歩と\n挑戦的な衣装を合わせることで、魅力が増すんだよ。", "zh": "对对。正是同样的道理，把沉稳的雪步和充满挑战性的服装搭配在一起，就能让魅力更上一层楼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "06484afc955cf1c5aa60e89b2aa9d4be255f3698968670155dd42a6e4151c105", "ja": "わぁ……。なんだか聞いているうちに、ますます、\nとっても素敵な感じがしてきました……！", "zh": "哇……听你这么一说，总觉得越来越觉得，这套衣服真的特别棒了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1abe265766c06645ef4cc6261ee84f7f867780a5ec54bcf970a6c4872ccd2026", "ja": "私、普段着でも……この衣装みたいな、思いきった\nファッションに挑戦してみようかなぁ……。", "zh": "我平时穿的衣服……也想试着挑战一下像这套服装这样大胆的穿搭……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cd14814ed824e6f477790c3e0fb7515db94218154c9c0c7a8ff9f4b928bd473d", "ja": "いいんじゃないか。きっと、雪歩の新しい魅力が\n見つかると思うよ。", "zh": "挺好的呀。我觉得一定能发现\n雪步崭新的魅力哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "15fb8184244654e6a689de7abe03a62c836815cdf43f57b05a9749c8ce0ac60e", "ja": "あ、でも、いきなりは恥ずかしいから……\nちょっとずつ、やってみますぅ。", "zh": "啊，不过一下子就开始的话会很害羞……\n我会一点一点试试的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0144_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7ffa197d6c03e1013d0e7e0e03db599f65186d05d9e892f534cfb94f2ed7009b", "ja": "{$P$}も、\nちょっとずつ……見てくださいね？　えへへ♪", "zh": "{$P$}也要，\n一点一点地……看着我哦？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
